        <mxCell id="note" value="Host: online-boutique… → frontend:8080 · prometheus… → :9090 · grafana… → :80. Gateway API ada, traffic toko tidak lewat situ.&lt;br&gt;frontend → catalog, currency, cart, recommendation, shipping, checkout, ads. checkout → catalog, shipping, payment, email, currency, cart.&lt;br&gt;recommendation → catalog · cart → redis. Tanpa Linkerd. loadgenerator dan frontend-external dihapus." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#86EFAC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#374151;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;arcSize=8;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
